    {tab:"supplements",name:"Protein",type:"FOUNDATION",use:"Muscle repair, maintenance and growth",timing:"Spread protein across meals; post-workout timing is useful but not magic",dose:"Aim from total daily protein needs first; use powder only to fill gaps",risk:"Check ingredients/allergens and kidney/medical context with a clinician if relevant."},
